title: TunnelMan_LoadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase_TunnelMan= "">>
<<setPhase TunnelMan>>
<<if $dialoguePhase_TunnelMan == "begin">>
<<jump TunnelMan_Begin01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_TunnelMan == "comeback">>
<<jump TunnelMan_Comeback01>>
<<else>>
Someone: You are not yet ready.
<<endif>>
===
title: TunnelMan_Begin01
---
<<camMove TunnelMan_CamRig "npc">>
Someone: You've done well to get here.
Someone: You've journeyed long and hard and found all you need.
Someone: There is no need for words. Take this.
<<collectMaxwell GameController>>
<<camMove TunnelMan_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase TunnelMan "comeback">>
===
title: TunnelMan_Comeback01
---
<<camMove TunnelMan_CamRig "npc">>
Someone: You seem troubled.
Someone: Could it be you didn't really find what you wanted?
<<camMove TunnelMan_CamRig "return">>
===